notes.body:
Previously there was a PDU item at protocol level in the tree.

![before](/uploads/9022cd24de435a8a91b250621b7f997a/before.png){width=396 height=181}

After the changes the PDUs (operations) are collected below one NATS item at protocol level.

![after](/uploads/fa96b27f8412c68c09820a0ce8df0725/after.png){width=396 height=181}

